# Names only; never commit values (AGENTS.md §12).
# Set Preview and Production separately in the Vercel project onyou123.
# Those two environments use different Neon branches (docs/deployment.md).
# DATABASE_URL is the pooled connection used by the running app.
# DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED is the direct connection used by prisma migrate deploy.
# SHADOW_DATABASE_URL is only for local prisma migrate dev drift checks.
# TEST_DATABASE_URL is only for local and CI integration tests.
DATABASE_URL=
DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED=
SHADOW_DATABASE_URL=
TEST_DATABASE_URL=
